Z||000036||Voytek||08-15-2001||01:14 PM||||Ok, I've seen your mods before and thought they looked good, but this is awesome!  I would buy it based on the side view but definitely need to see the front/rear.  Since you're looking for feedback, here are some comments:<BR>1.  Keep the trunk accessible - I would only buy a kit if it has a trunk (I believe the Finale does not).<BR>2.  Around $4500 US sounds pretty good.  I'd definitely be interested within about 2 years (funds will be available then).<BR>3.  I DO like the Fiero pop-up headlights - they are VERY unique.  I would take a vote and see if the market prefers original headlights or fixed ones.<P>The bright yellow is the one for me.  Curious to see the front / rear.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
